  "title": "AXIL Brands Announces Full Range of Advanced Hearing Protection and Enhancement Products at U.S. Marine Corps Exchanges (MCX)",
  "summary": "LOS ANGELES, June 17, 2026 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) AXIL Brands, Inc. (“AXIL,” “we,” “us,” “our,” or the “Company”) (NYSE American: AXIL), an emerging global consumer products company for AXIL® hearing protection and enhancement products and Reviv3® hair and skin care products, is proud to announce that its full range of premium products is expected to be available in July at selected Marine Corps Exchange (MCX) locations in the United States.",
